      "content": "Neptune Analytics is a memory-optimized graph database engine for analytics, providing optimized graph analytic algorithms, low-latency queries, and vector search capabilities within graph traversals. This API provides management operations for Neptune Analytics graph resources including creating, managing, and querying graph databases optimized for analytical workloads.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
